  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Script Assets_en-US
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-US
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bae3f0c0768e84a4b91ae3b46e2c292f, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 1944176950501704265
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 23825497923584
    m_Localized: Entrance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923585
    m_Localized: In a corner near the entrance are some sports supplies, including
      hula hoops, children's sandbags, jump ropes, and colorful plastic balls. They
      seem to have been prepared for today's sports day. On the corridor wall leading
      to the staff room is a bulletin board displaying the children's work, some
      daily notices, and Hope Orphanage's staff organization chart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923586
    m_Localized: Staff Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923587
    m_Localized: The staff room is a small office. Except for the director, every
      staff member has their own workspace, with their name attached to their desk.
      Zhang Huiling's desk has the schedule for the sports day. Wang Xiuli's desk
      has some of the children's half-graded homework. A small note reminding Li
      Xiufang of her password is stuck to the edge of her computer monitor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923588
    m_Localized: Introduction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923589
    m_Localized: '- July 31 -'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923590
    m_Localized: After returning home from solving a simple case, I glanced at the
      date on my phone, then at the expiration date on my detective license... Only
      one month left. It's about time I retook the detective qualification test to
      renew it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923591
    m_Localized: I'm pretty confident I can pass the qualification test again, but
      just in case, I should do some practice questions. After all, test questions
      are still a little different from real-life cases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923592
    m_Localized: I sat down at my computer, opened the Detective Association's website,
      and accessed the practice test they had made available...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923593
    m_Localized: (Missing Cat Case)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923594
    m_Localized: By the time I finished the practice questions, it was already getting
      late. After a simple dinner and washing up, I lay down in bed and drifted off
      to sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923595
    m_Localized: '- August 1 -'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923596
    m_Localized: I opened my eyes to another new day. I wonder if I'll get any well-paying
      jobs today. If not, something interesting would be fine too. With those idle
      thoughts in mind, I routinely opened a news site to see what was happening
      today. Keeping up with the latest information is basic practice for a detective,
      after all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825497923597
    m_Localized: -- Read "Hope Orphanage Fire; Director Missing!" --
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813002
    m_Localized: I didn't expect something like this to happen while I was asleep.
      Judging from the article and the comments below, it didn't seem to be just
      a simple fire accident either. Just as I was about to look for more information,
      the doorbell rang.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813003
    m_Localized: I left the computer to answer the door. Standing outside was a middle-aged
      woman. The moment she saw me, she spoke.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813004
    m_Localized: '"Are you that famous detective? Please take my case!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813005
    m_Localized: '"Did you see the news about the orphanage this morning? I''ve worked
      there for a long time. For some reason, our director seems to have been accused
      of things he never did. I''ve worked with him for so long, and I don''t believe
      he''s the kind of person who would do something like that."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813006
    m_Localized: '"It is suspicious that he disappeared at a time like this, though.
      That''s why I want you to investigate and find out whether the director is
      innocent."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813007
    m_Localized: After hearing her out, I decided to accept the case and uncover
      the truth hidden beneath the surface.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813008
    m_Localized: OvO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813009
    m_Localized: 'Announcement: Regarding the Continued Operation of Hope Orphanage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813010
    m_Localized: 'Publication Date: May 2, 2009'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813011
    m_Localized: 'Thank you for the concern and encouragement you have recently shown
      Hope Orphanage.


      We are pleased to announce that, with the care and
      support of the community, our current operational difficulties have improved
      and the orphanage will continue operating. The previously planned closure has
      therefore been cancelled.


      Moving forward, we will remain committed
      to providing the children with a safe, stable, and warm environment in which
      to grow. We will also make responsible use of every generous contribution to
      create better learning and living conditions for them.


      Sincerely, Hope
      Orphanage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813012
    m_Localized: We are pleased to announce that, with the care and support of the
      community, our current operational difficulties have improved and the orphanage
      will continue operating. The previously planned closure has therefore been
      cancelled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813013
    m_Localized: Moving forward, we will remain committed to providing the children
      with a safe, stable, and warm environment in which to grow. We will also make
      responsible use of every generous contribution to create better learning and
      living conditions for them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813014
    m_Localized: Sincerely, Hope Orphanage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813015
    m_Localized: 'Announcement: Regarding the Closure of Hope Orphanage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813016
    m_Localized: 'Publication Date: April 18, 2009'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813017
    m_Localized: 'Thank you for your long-standing care and support for Hope Orphanage.


      Due
      to persistent shortages in operating funds in recent years, along with increasing
      building maintenance and childcare expenses, the orphanage is currently facing
      serious financial difficulties. After extensive evaluation, Hope Orphanage
      is expected to cease operations in the near future.


      We are currently
      working closely with relevant government departments and child welfare organizations
      to properly arrange the children''s future care and placement, in hopes of
      minimizing the impact this situation may have on them.


      Sincerely, Hope
      Orphanage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813018
    m_Localized: Due to persistent shortages in operating funds in recent years,
      along with increasing building maintenance and childcare expenses, the orphanage
      is currently facing serious financial difficulties. After extensive evaluation,
      Hope Orphanage is expected to cease operations in the near future.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813019
    m_Localized: We are currently working closely with relevant government departments
      and child welfare organizations to properly arrange the children's future care
      and placement, in hopes of minimizing the impact this situation may have on
      them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813020
    m_Localized: Sincerely, Hope Orphanage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813021
    m_Localized: Home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813022
    m_Localized: Bookshelf
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813023
    m_Localized: Various books are neatly arranged on the bookshelf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813024
    m_Localized: Books useful for detective work, such as "The Detective's Guide
      to Self-Improvement," "Hypothetical Logic Training," and "The Memory Palace
      Method."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813025
    m_Localized: There are also novels, comics, magazines, and other books collected
      out of personal interest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813026
    m_Localized: Computer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813027
    m_Localized: Can be used to search for information online or browse various websites
      and social media platforms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813028
    m_Localized: Clue Board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813029
    m_Localized: Organize all relevant clues here and deduce the truth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047897813030
    m_Localized: First-Aid Kit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007296
    m_Localized: There is a small first-aid kit on the bottom shelf of the bookshelf,
      marked with a blue butterfly logo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007297
    m_Localized: You bought it just in case after you started living alone. Thankfully,
      you've been healthy enough that the first-aid kit hasn't had a chance to do
      its job yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007298
    m_Localized: Social Media
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007299
    m_Localized: Can't find him after the fire? The director seems kinda shady.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007300
    m_Localized: Comments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007301
    m_Localized: So he really did run away, huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007302
    m_Localized: Seriously, there's no way the timing is that perfect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007303
    m_Localized: The news only says he's missing for now. Isn't it a bit early to
      jump to conclusions?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007304
    m_Localized: How does a fire suddenly start by accident in the middle of the
      night? Thank goodness someone woke up and noticed it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007305
    m_Localized: Comments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007306
    m_Localized: Was it really an accident?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007307
    m_Localized: Maybe the building is old and there was a problem with the wiring
      somewhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007308
    m_Localized: But that orphanage looks really well maintained. Didn't it even
      win some kind of beautification award?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007309
    m_Localized: Either way, thank goodness the kids are safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007310
    m_Localized: Am I the only one worried about what will happen to those kids now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007311
    m_Localized: Comments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007312
    m_Localized: They'll probably be sent to some temporary shelter or placement
      center.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007313
    m_Localized: Our association just received word. I think that's where they're
      going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007314
    m_Localized: I just hope the kids aren't too frightened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007315
    m_Localized: The staff will probably go with them and stay by their side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007316
    m_Localized: 'Fire Department reminds you: In the event of a fire, please:


      1.
      If conditions allow, shout loudly to alert others nearby.

      2. Wet a towel,
      cover your nose and mouth, and stay low while moving.

      3. Leave the fire
      scene immediately. Do not risk your safety for belongings.

      4. Do not
      use elevators. Use the stairs to evacuate.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007317
    m_Localized: '1. If conditions allow, shout loudly to alert others nearby.

      2.
      Wet a towel, cover your nose and mouth, and stay low while moving.

      3.
      Leave the fire scene immediately. Do not risk your safety for belongings.

      4.
      Do not use elevators. Use the stairs to evacuate.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007318
    m_Localized: Comments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007319
    m_Localized: Thanks for the reminder. Shared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007320
    m_Localized: Hope none of us ever have to use this knowledge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007321
    m_Localized: Would it be better to keep a fire extinguisher at home?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007322
    m_Localized: Saw an insanely black car late last night. Even the windows were
      as black as my black cat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007323
    m_Localized: Comments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007324
    m_Localized: Isn't everything black in the middle of the night?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007325
    m_Localized: Didn't you get a photo? If it was violating traffic laws, you could
      report it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007326
    m_Localized: I remember reading somewhere that the orphanage was already planning
      to close down. The director must not have wanted to deal with the aftermath,
      so he just set the place on fire, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007327
    m_Localized: Comments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007328
    m_Localized: Wasn't it supposed to be making a lot of money? Why would it close?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007329
    m_Localized: Really? That sounds a little different from what I heard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007330
    m_Localized: Either way, this is getting more and more suspicious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007331
    m_Localized: I went over to that orphanage where the incident happened just to
      see what was going on, and when I zoomed in with my camera, I got this shot.
      People really do use their birthdays as passwords, huh? Hahahaha.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007332
    m_Localized: '[A photo taken through the window shows one of the computers in
      the orphanage staff room. A note stuck to the edge of the monitor says the
      password is a birthday.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007333
    m_Localized: Comments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007334
    m_Localized: I do that too. Passwords are seriously hard to remember.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007335
    m_Localized: Someone needs better security awareness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007336
    m_Localized: 'Meow Meow: 3'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007337
    m_Localized: Bio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007338
    m_Localized: 'A volunteer

      Cat Lover'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007339
    m_Localized: "My cat\u2019s in a bad mood today and won\u2019t even give me any
      attention\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007340
    m_Localized: Photos of Kindness Welfare Home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007341
    m_Localized: "How can something this cute even exist?! \u2764"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007342
    m_Localized: (If the board gets shifted, press Ctrl + 0 to return to the center.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007343
    m_Localized: Hope Orphanage Official Website
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007344
    m_Localized: '"Hope Orphanage" "Hope Orphanage official website"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007345
    m_Localized: 'Notice: Temporary Suspension of Child Adoption Applications'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007346
    m_Localized: 'Event: Hope Orphanage Mini Sports Day'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007347
    m_Localized: 'Notice: Regarding the Continued Operation of Hope Orphanage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007348
    m_Localized: 'Notice: Regarding the Closure of Hope Orphanage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007349
    m_Localized: 'Announcement: Temporary Suspension of Child Adoption Applications'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007350
    m_Localized: 'Publication Date: July 19, 2012'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007351
    m_Localized: 'To further improve our childcare system and accommodate the orphanage''s
      recent review of adoption procedures and related records, we will temporarily
      stop accepting new child adoption applications effective immediately. The date
      applications resume will be announced separately depending on our internal
      progress. We apologize for any inconvenience caused.


      Thank you for
      the care and support you have always shown the children. We hope you will continue
      to accompany and support them as they grow up healthy and happy.


      Sincerely,
      Hope Orphanage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007352
    m_Localized: Thank you for the care and support you have always shown the children.
      We hope you will continue to accompany and support them as they grow up healthy
      and happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007353
    m_Localized: Sincerely, Hope Orphanage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007354
    m_Localized: 'Event: Hope Orphanage Mini Sports Day'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007355
    m_Localized: 'Publication Date: July 13, 2012'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007356
    m_Localized: 'Our orphanage will hold its annual mini sports day on the upcoming
      August 1.


      The children will take part in all kinds of fun competitions,
      winning prizes and making wonderful memories through laughter and challenges.


      On
      the day of the event, the orphanage will be open to visitors. We sincerely
      invite everyone to come cheer the children on and spend a lively, joyful time
      with them.


      Event Date: August 1, 2012

      Event Time: 9:00 a.m.
      - 1:00 p.m.

      Event Location: Hope Orphanage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007357
    m_Localized: The children will take part in all kinds of fun competitions, winning
      prizes and making wonderful memories through laughter and challenges.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007358
    m_Localized: On the day of the event, the orphanage will be open to visitors.
      We sincerely invite everyone to come cheer the children on and spend a lively,
      joyful time with them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007359
    m_Localized: 'Event Date: August 1, 2012'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007360
    m_Localized: 'Event Time: 9:00 a.m. - 1:00 p.m.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007361
    m_Localized: 'Event Location: Hope Orphanage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047902007362
    m_Localized: Hope Orphanage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201600
    m_Localized: '"Location: Hope Orphanage"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201601
    m_Localized: From a distance, you can see that part of the orphanage has been
      charred black. Relevant personnel have put up "Authorized Personnel Only" tape
      while carrying out repairs and follow-up investigations. A few local residents
      are also scattered around nearby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201602
    m_Localized: You can observe the orphanage from a short distance, ask the personnel
      on site for permission to enter and investigate, or ask nearby residents for
      information.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201603
    m_Localized: Observe the Orphanage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201604
    m_Localized: It seems the fire was brought under control in time, and only about
      a quarter of the building was badly charred. ~~If the orphanage layout is still
      the way you remember it, the burned area seems to include the director's office.~~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201605
    m_Localized: Information Inside the Orphanage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201606
    m_Localized: Near the Entrance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201607
    m_Localized: After showing your detective ID to a nearby police officer and receiving
      permission, you enter the orphanage to investigate. In a corner near the entrance
      are some sports supplies, including hula hoops, children's sandbags, jump ropes,
      and colorful plastic balls. They seem to have been prepared for today's sports
      day. On the corridor wall leading to the staff room is a bulletin board displaying
      the children's work, some daily notices, and Hope Orphanage's staff organization
      chart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201608
    m_Localized: Staff Organization Chart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201609
    m_Localized: Contains the positions and photos of all staff members at Hope Orphanage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201610
    m_Localized: 'Director: Chen Zhihong'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201611
    m_Localized: 'Finance Staff: Huang Guoliang'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201612
    m_Localized: 'Education Staff: Wang Xiuli'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201613
    m_Localized: 'Head of Daily Care: Zhang Huiling (Client in this case)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201614
    m_Localized: 'Care Staff: Lin Meihua, Li Xiufang, Liu Zhiming'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201615
    m_Localized: '![](flowam:img-1787584472765-9g6phi =707x363)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201616
    m_Localized: Staff Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201617
    m_Localized: The staff room is a small office. Except for the director, every
      staff member has their own workspace, with their name attached to their desk.
      Zhang Huiling's desk has the schedule for the sports day. Wang Xiuli's desk
      has some half-graded homework. A small note reminding Li Xiufang of her password
      is stuck to the edge of her computer monitor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201618
    m_Localized: Information Obtained from Residents
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201619
    m_Localized: '"I suddenly heard an alarm and people shouting in the middle of
      the night. By the time I went outside to look, the fire was already pretty
      big."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201620
    m_Localized: '"Luckily, the staff had already gotten all the children out safely
      by then."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201621
    m_Localized: '"Recently, you could still see lights on in one of the orphanage
      rooms late at night. I think it was the room that got burned."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201622
    m_Localized: '"I was chatting with one of the staff recently and heard that more
      children have been adopted over the past few months."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201623
    m_Localized: '"What a shame. The children only get their sports day once a year,
      and now it''s been ruined. Such bad luck."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201624
    m_Localized: Kindness Welfare Home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201625
    m_Localized: '"Location: Kindness Welfare Home"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201626
    m_Localized: You arrive at Kindness Welfare Home, where volunteers are helping
      settle the children who were transferred here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201627
    m_Localized: Ask the Volunteers for Information
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201628
    m_Localized: 'Volunteer A: "After our group heard about the fire, we contacted
      the staff there right away and told them we could provide the children with
      a temporary shelter here."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201629
    m_Localized: 'Volunteer B: "Some of the children seem frightened. We''re preparing
      a few little games to play with them later. If you''re interested, you can
      join us too."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201630
    m_Localized: Ask the Children for Information
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201631
    m_Localized: Perhaps because of the accident and the unfamiliar surroundings,
      the children seem somewhat nervous. If you want to learn anything from them,
      you'll probably need to calm them down first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201632
    m_Localized: '[Obtain information after playing a mini-game with the children]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201633
    m_Localized: 'Child A: "Where did Director Chen go? Will we still get to see
      him...?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201634
    m_Localized: 'Child B: "I promised Director Chen that we would go dig for treasure
      in the park together."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201635
    m_Localized: 'Child C: "Hmm? I''m drawing a butterfly~ I saw a really pretty
      blue butterfly on a card Mr. Liu was holding before, and I want to draw it!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201636
    m_Localized: News Platform
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201637
    m_Localized: "BB-04 Breaks a Medical Barrier\u2014A Cure for Terminal Illnesses!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201638
    m_Localized: 'Publication Date: June 29, 2012'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201639
    m_Localized: 'Blue Morpho Pharmaceutical Company announced its latest research
      achievement, "BB-04," today. The drug is expected to potentially cure terminal
      illnesses that have long troubled the medical community, including cancer and
      AIDS.


      According to the project''s lead researcher, the drug is still
      in the experimental stage, but they believe BB-04 will become a medical miracle
      in the near future.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201640
    m_Localized: 'Publication Date: August 1, 2012'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201641
    m_Localized: '[Photo of the project lead giving a speech at the presentation]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201642
    m_Localized: A careful comparison reveals that the person speaking on stage is
      Liu Zhiming, one of the staff members at Hope Orphanage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201643
    m_Localized: Hope Orphanage Fire; Director Missing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201644
    m_Localized: 'In the early hours of today (August 1), a fire suddenly broke out
      at Hope Orphanage, located on the outskirts of town. Fortunately, several staff
      members were already awake when the incident occurred. They immediately reported
      the fire to the fire department and evacuated the children in an orderly manner.
      Firefighters soon arrived, contained the blaze, and extinguished it. Thanks
      to the staff''s quick response, there were no casualties.


      Just when
      it seemed the incident had ended without serious harm, news emerged that the
      orphanage director, Chen Zhihong, had gone missing. According to several staff
      members, they had seen the director before going to bed, but after the fire
      he was nowhere to be found and could not be contacted. Firefighters also found
      no sign of anyone matching the director at the scene. The matter has been reported
      to the police and is being treated as a missing-person case.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201645
    m_Localized: Just when it seemed the incident had ended without serious harm,
      news emerged that the orphanage director, Chen Zhihong, had gone missing. According
      to several staff members, they had seen the director before going to bed, but
      after the fire he was nowhere to be found and could not be contacted. Firefighters
      also found no sign of anyone matching the director at the scene. The matter
      has been reported to the police and is being treated as a missing-person case.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201646
    m_Localized: Comments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201647
    m_Localized: "Thank goodness they noticed it in time\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201648
    m_Localized: Did they say what caused the fire?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201649
    m_Localized: The director probably took the money and ran.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201650
    m_Localized: Seriously?! Then did the director start the fire too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201651
    m_Localized: Where are all those orphans going to stay now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201652
    m_Localized: A tiny orphanage managed to operate for this long. They were probably
      doing something shady behind the scenes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201653
    m_Localized: "Hope Orphanage Fire and Director's Disappearance\u2014Were There
      Suspicious Signs Before the Incident?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201654
    m_Localized: 'A fire broke out at Hope Orphanage early this morning. After receiving
      the emergency call, the fire department quickly arrived at the scene and successfully
      brought the blaze under control. Fortunately, all children and staff members
      were evacuated in time, and there were no casualties. Our reporter immediately
      interviewed nearby residents and gathered the following accounts.


      One
      resident said the orphanage''s facilities appeared to be regularly inspected
      and renovated, so an accidental fire seemed unlikely. Another said that for
      the past month, Director Chen Zhihong had been leaving early and returning
      late every day, which was unlike his usual behavior. A third resident reported
      seeing a black sedan parked near the orphanage that night.



      Comments
      are closed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201655
    m_Localized: One resident said the orphanage's facilities appeared to be regularly
      inspected and renovated, so an accidental fire seemed unlikely. Another said
      that for the past month, Director Chen Zhihong had been leaving early and returning
      late every day, which was unlike his usual behavior. A third resident reported
      seeing a black sedan parked near the orphanage that night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201656
    m_Localized: Comments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201657
    m_Localized: Comments are closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201658
    m_Localized: Hope Orphanage Was Once WHAT?! Was This Fire Destined to Happen...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201659
    m_Localized: The site where Hope Orphanage now stands is suspected to have once
      been a cemetery several decades ago. Our reporter interviewed several professional
      feng shui masters, all of whom claimed that the fire was caused by an accumulation
      of negative energy in the area. Some even suggested that the director's disappearance
      may be connected to it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201660
    m_Localized: Comments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201661
    m_Localized: "Now they're bringing feng shui into this\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201662
    m_Localized: There are some things you just can't dismiss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201663
    m_Localized: Who are these experts? They didn't even give any names.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201664
    m_Localized: Blue Morpho Pharmaceutical Company Official Website
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201665
    m_Localized: '"blue butterfly" "blue butterfly"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201666
    m_Localized: -- Exploring the Frontiers of Science, Bringing the Miracle of the
      Blue Morpho to Everyone --
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201667
    m_Localized: We will bring miracles in the near future.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201668
    m_Localized: Describes the drug's effects and the major breakthrough it represents
      for modern medicine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201669
    m_Localized: Park
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201670
    m_Localized: '"Location: Park"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201671
    m_Localized: A small park near the orphanage with only a few types of playground
      equipment. An elderly man can be seen feeding pigeons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201672
    m_Localized: Ask the Elderly Man for Information
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201673
    m_Localized: '"I come to this park pretty often to take walks and feed the pigeons.
      The children from the nearby orphanage come here from time to time too, and
      I play with them."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201674
    m_Localized: '"The last time they came, they told me they were having a sports
      day today and invited me to watch. I never expected something like this to
      happen."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201675
    m_Localized: '"Come to think of it, I once ran into Director Chen by chance.
      Without explaining anything, he asked me to keep a key for him. Now that this
      has happened to him, I don''t know what I should do with it."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201676
    m_Localized: '"Why don''t you take the key for now? Compared with leaving it
      with me, you''re more likely to uncover something with it during your investigation."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201677
    m_Localized: 'Detective Qualification Practice Test: "The Missing Cat"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201678
    m_Localized: Mr. Zhao
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047906201679
    m_Localized: '"At around 3:30 p.m., my daughter and I happened to pass by the
      park and saw Little Orange. I''m certain it was Little Orange because of the
      notch in its left ear. I even took a photo of my daughter with Little Orange
      on my phone. This is the photo from then."


      Photo of Mr. Zhao''s Daughter
      and Little Orange

      The photo shows a young girl apparently trying to
      sneak up on an orange cat lying on the ground. A small notch can clearly be
      seen on the cat''s left ear.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395904
    m_Localized: Photo of Mr. Zhao's Daughter and Little Orange
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395905
    m_Localized: The photo shows a young girl apparently trying to sneak up on an
      orange cat lying on the ground. A small notch can clearly be seen on the cat's
      left ear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395906
    m_Localized: Mr. Chen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395907
    m_Localized: '"I stayed home all afternoon today. I did hear a dog barking near
      the yard, and afterward I heard what sounded like a cat meowing nearby."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395908
    m_Localized: Mr. Zhou
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395909
    m_Localized: '"At around 3:55 p.m., I needed some tools, so I went to the village''s
      communal storage shed. I saw Little Orange nearby. It was lying leisurely in
      the sun by the storage shed entrance."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395910
    m_Localized: Village Map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395911
    m_Localized: '![](flowam:img-1787584472766-7q5cir)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395912
    m_Localized: Case Request
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395913
    m_Localized: 'Client: Ms. Zhang

      My cat, "Little Orange," went missing
      this afternoon.

      Although Little Orange usually wanders around nearby,
      it normally doesn''t go far from home.

      This afternoon, I noticed it
      hadn''t come back as usual. I searched for a while but still couldn''t find
      it.

      Fortunately, five nearby residents said they had seen Little Orange.

      However,
      the information they provided does not seem entirely consistent.

      Based
      on the information below, determine which witnesses'' statements are reliable.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395914
    m_Localized: My cat, "Little Orange," went missing this afternoon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395915
    m_Localized: Although Little Orange usually wanders around nearby, it normally
      doesn't go far from home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395916
    m_Localized: This afternoon, I noticed it hadn't come back as usual. I searched
      for a while but still couldn't find it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395917
    m_Localized: Fortunately, five nearby residents said they had seen Little Orange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395918
    m_Localized: However, the information they provided does not seem entirely consistent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395919
    m_Localized: Based on the information below, determine which witnesses' statements
      are reliable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395920
    m_Localized: About Little Orange
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395921
    m_Localized: A cat owned by the client, Ms. Zhang. It went missing this afternoon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395922
    m_Localized: 'Ms. Zhang says the following about Little Orange:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395923
    m_Localized: '"I adopted Little Orange four years ago. It has orange fur all
      over. It''s extremely afraid of dogs because a stray dog bit its ear when it
      was young, leaving a noticeable notch near the tip of its left ear. I still
      saw Little Orange at 3:00 p.m. while I was cleaning the living room."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395924
    m_Localized: Mr. Wang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395925
    m_Localized: '"I work at a convenience store, and I happened to be on shift at
      the time. At around 3:15 p.m., I saw an orange cat walk past the store entrance.
      Maybe I can check the outdoor security footage to see whether it was Little
      Orange."

      "Found it. This is the image captured at the time. I remember
      it running toward the park."


      Convenience Store Security Footage

      The
      image shows an orange cat. There is a small notch on its left ear.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395926
    m_Localized: '"Found it. This is the image captured at the time. I remember it
      running toward the park."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395927
    m_Localized: Convenience Store Security Footage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395928
    m_Localized: The image shows an orange cat. There is a small notch on its left
      ear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395929
    m_Localized: Ms. Li
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395930
    m_Localized: '"At around 4:00 p.m., I was just about to head out when I saw Little
      Orange being chased by a dog toward Mr. Chen''s house."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395931
    m_Localized: How to Play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395932
    m_Localized: '1. Do not move the board.

      2. Read the introduction first,
      then investigate freely.

      3. To search online, press Ctrl + F. First
      enter a quotation mark ("), then type the keyword between the quotation marks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395933
    m_Localized: '```

      Example: "keyword"

      ```'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395934
    m_Localized: 4. To investigate outside locations, press Ctrl + F. First enter
      "Location:", then type the location name after the colon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395935
    m_Localized: '```

      Example: "Location: Location Name"

      ```'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8047910395936
    m_Localized: Pay attention to your input method. If it doesn't work, copy & paste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
